### OTP API Testing
### Use REST Client extension in VS Code or similar tool
### Or use curl commands below

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@phone = 081234567890

### 1. Request OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "{{phone}}",
  "type": "REGISTER"
}

### 2. Verify OTP (replace with actual code received)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "{{phone}}",
  "code": "123456",
  "type": "REGISTER"
}

### 3. Test Rate Limit (request 4 times quickly)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "{{phone}}",
  "type": "REGISTER"
}
